{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["sv"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Anv\u00e4nd backspace-tangenten f\u00f6r att radera."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["V\u00e4nster, upp\u00e5t och ned\u00e5t piltangenterna \u00e4r inaktiverade. Detsamma g\u00e4ller tangenterna home, end, pgup och pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Anv\u00e4nd backspace f\u00f6r att radera."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Om v\u00e4rdet \u00e4r valt \u00e4r det bara att b\u00f6rja skriva in ett nytt v\u00e4rde f\u00f6r att radera det tidigare v\u00e4rdet."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["N\u00e4r ett nummer \u00e4r valt (v\u00e4rdet visas i omv\u00e4nt l\u00e4ge) kan du anv\u00e4nda h\u00f6gerpilen f\u00f6r att radera valet utan att radera v\u00e4rdet. Backa sedan f\u00f6r att redigera."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["TIPS: I allm\u00e4nhet \u00e4r det b\u00e4st att anv\u00e4nda TAB- eller SHIFT-TAB-tangenterna f\u00f6r att g\u00e5 fr\u00e5n en inmatning till n\u00e4sta eller f\u00f6reg\u00e5ende inmatning."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["TIPS 2: Generellt sett \u00e4r det ineffektivt att redigera ett v\u00e4rde. Eftersom v\u00e4rdena \u00e4r automatiskt valda \u00e4r det bara att skriva in den siffra du vill ha."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Ange inte separatortecknet f\u00f6r tusen."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Om du anv\u00e4nder amerikansk konvention, \u00e4r det ett kommatecken.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Jag \u00e4r smart nog att skriva in dem \u00e5t dig!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Ett ok\u00e4nt datumber\u00e4kningsfel har intr\u00e4ffat."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["V\u00e4nligen ge oss dina inmatningar och inst\u00e4llningar s\u00e5 att vi kan \u00e5tg\u00e4rda detta. Tack."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Datumet \u00e4r inte giltigt - felaktigt \u00e5r."],"Jan":["jan"],"Feb":["feb"],"Mar":["mar"],"Apr":["apr"],"May":["maj"],"Jun":["jun"],"Jul":["jul"],"Aug":["aug"],"Sept":["sep"],"Oct":["okt"],"Nov":["nov"],"Dec":["dec"],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Fel: datum i fel ordning."],"Exception":["Undantag"],"occurred when accessing":["intr\u00e4ffade vid \u00e5tkomst till"],"Invalid index":["Ogiltigt index"],"Unknown":["Ok\u00e4nd"],"u":["o"],"U":["O"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Intern gr\u00e4ns har n\u00e5tts. Saldot \u00f6verstiger +\/- 99 biljoner."],"YTD":["\u00c5TD"],"Running Totals":["L\u00f6pande summor"],"Normal":["Normal"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Din personliga l\u00e5neplan"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Det senaste betalningsbeloppet har minskat med"],"due to rounding":["p\u00e5 grund av avrundning"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Det senaste betalningsbeloppet har \u00f6kat med"],"Loan Summary":["L\u00e5nesammanfattning"],"Loan Amount":["L\u00e5nebelopp"],"Number of Payments":["Antal betalningar"],"Annual Interest Rate":["\u00c5rsr\u00e4ntesats"],"Periodic Payment":["Periodisk betalning"],"Loan Date":["L\u00e5nedatum"],"1st Payment Due":["1:a betalning f\u00f6rfaller"],"Payment Frequency":["Betalningsfrekvens"],"Last Payment Due":["F\u00f6rfallodag f\u00f6r sista betalning"],"Total Interest Due":["Total r\u00e4nta"],"Total All Payments":["Totala betalningar"],"Payment Schedule":["Betalningsplan"],"Year":["\u00c5r"],"Date":["Datum"],"Payment":["Betalning"],"Interest":["R\u00e4nta"],"Principal":["Kapitalbelopp"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Ber\u00e4kningsmetod: Normal"],"Total Principal":["Totalt kapitalbelopp"],"Total Interest":["Total r\u00e4nta"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["% av totala betalningar"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["\u00c5rliga totalsummor f\u00f6r kapital och r\u00e4nta"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Ackumulerat kapital och r\u00e4nta med \u00e5terst\u00e5ende saldo"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Totalkapital- och r\u00e4ntesumma"],"Loan":["L\u00e5n"],"There are too many unknown values.":["Det finns f\u00f6r m\u00e5nga ok\u00e4nda v\u00e4rden."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["Ange \"L\u00e5nebelopp\", \"Antal betalningar\" och \"\u00c5rlig r\u00e4nta\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Hj\u00e4lp med l\u00e5nekalkylator...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>Att anv\u00e4nda kalkylatorn \u00e4r enkelt. Anv\u00e4ndaren anger ett \"l\u00e5nebelopp\", \"antal m\u00e5nader\", \"\u00e5rlig r\u00e4nta\". Kalkylatorn ber\u00e4knar det m\u00e5natliga betalningsbeloppet.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>\"tidpunkt f\u00f6r betalning\" avg\u00f6r n\u00e4r den f\u00f6rsta betalningen f\u00f6rfaller. Med standardvalet \"Slutet av perioden\" f\u00f6rfaller den f\u00f6rsta betalningen en m\u00e5nad efter att l\u00e5net beviljats. Om \"B\u00f6rjan av perioden\" v\u00e4ljs, f\u00f6rfaller den f\u00f6rsta betalningen p\u00e5 l\u00e5nedatumet.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">L\u00e5nets l\u00f6ptid uttrycks som ett antal m\u00e5nader.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 m\u00e5nader = &nbsp;5 \u00e5r<\/li><li>120 m\u00e5nader = 10 \u00e5r<\/li><li>180 m\u00e5nader = 15 \u00e5r<\/li><li>240 m\u00e5nader = 20 \u00e5r<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 m\u00e5nader = 30 \u00e5r<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Beh\u00f6ver du fler alternativ, inklusive m\u00f6jligheten att l\u00f6sa f\u00f6r andra ok\u00e4nda variabler? St\u00e4ll in datumen? St\u00e4ll in eller \u00e4ndra betalnings- och r\u00e4ntesamlingsfrekvenserna? Skriv ut schemat? Exportera till MS Word&trade; (.docx) eller MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) filer? V\u00e4nligen bes\u00f6k, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datum m\u00e5ste vara den f\u00f6rsta dagen i m\u00e5naden."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Ett ogiltigt JavaScript-datumobjekt."],"Monthly":["M\u00e5natlig"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Beh\u00f6ver du fler alternativ, inklusive m\u00f6jligheten att l\u00f6sa f\u00f6r andra ok\u00e4nda variabler? St\u00e4ll in datumen? St\u00e4ll in eller \u00e4ndra betalnings- och r\u00e4ntesamlingsfrekvenserna? Skriv ut diagrammen? Exportera till MS Word&trade; (.docx) eller MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) filer? V\u00e4nligen bes\u00f6k, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["F\u00f6rberett f\u00f6r"],"Address":["Adress"],"City, State  ZIP":["Stad, L\u00e4n, Postnummer"],"Prepared On":["F\u00f6rberedd den"],"Prepared by":["F\u00f6rberedd av"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-post"],"Website":["Webbplats"]}}}